      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    face_value = 10000\n    coupon_rate = 0.05\n    discount_rate = 0.04\n    years = 5\n\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n\n    # Calculate the present value of coupon payments and face value\n    pv_coupons = sum(\n        annual_coupon / ((1 + discount_rate) ** year)\n        for year in range(1, years + 1)\n    )\n    pv_face_value = face_value / ((1 + discount_rate) ** years)\n\n    bond_value = pv_coupons + pv_face_value\n\n    # Return the value rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(bond_value)\n```",
